---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { app, links } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Community & beta" description="Join the MacDigiPet Discord community for development updates and conversation. A beta is planned, but no release date has been set; testing is optional.">
  <div class="wrap narrow page">
    <p class="eyebrow">macOS · Community &amp; planned beta</p>
    <h1>Join the village.</h1>
    <p>Come follow MacDigiPet’s development, share ideas and hang out with fellow Digimon fans in Discord. You’re welcome to join even if you don’t want to take part in beta testing.</p>
    <div class="row actions"><a class="btn" href={links.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join Discord</a><a class="btn alt" href="/wallpaper">Try the free wallpaper</a></div>
    <h2>A beta is planned</h2>
    <p>MacDigiPet is still in development, and no beta release date has been set. We’re gathering interest for future testing; joining now does not mean a build is available to try. Timing and testing details will be shared in Discord when they’re ready.</p>
    <h2>Interested in future testing?</h2>
    <p>If you’ve played and completed Digimon World 1 and would like to help test the care, evolution and village, you can share your interest. This is optional—you can simply join the community and follow along.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Join the Discord community using the button above.</li>
      <li>If you’d like to test, post in <strong>#beta-interest</strong>. Include your Mac model/chip and macOS version, confirm that you completed Digimon World 1, and briefly describe your playthrough and what you’d like to help test.</li>
      <li>Follow the development updates. When testing is ready, the developer will review interest and assign the <strong>Beta Tester</strong> role manually. Selected testers will use private download, feedback and bug-report channels.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="notice">The completed-Digimon-World-1 requirement applies to beta testers only. Everyone is welcome in the community. Expressing interest does not reserve a slot or guarantee access or a release date; donations do not guarantee or prioritize access.</div>
    <h2>What to expect from future builds</h2>
    <p>Early builds may have bugs. The current app targets macOS {app.minMacOS}; build-specific requirements will be shared when testing is ready. Saves stay on your Mac.</p>
    <p>This website does not collect your email or store a signup. Interest is handled manually in Discord, under Discord’s own account and privacy settings. Please keep personal details out of public messages.</p>
    <h2>Keep the project growing</h2>
    <p>Sharing ideas and following development help the project grow. If you also want to support development time and tools, you can leave a voluntary tip on <a href={links.kofi} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ko-fi</a> or <a href={links.saweria} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saweria</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
